        ]
      },
      {
        "page": 5,
        "text": "So when the other child offered the toy back, Kavi smiled and said, \"We can both take turns.\" In that gentle choice, Kavi truly discovered, \"I can pause and choose my response.\" The game began again, and this time the laughter sounded freer than before.",
